        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The Union shall submit to the Employer, a notarized list showing the name and payroll number of each employee who is a member of the Union on the date this Agreement is effective, and, on or before the last day of each month, shall submit a further such list of any employees who have become members since the date of submission of the last prior list.",
